        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba ūlū ūmala ī milīmo yakwe ū kū lūgūlū lwa Sayuni nī Yelusalemu, akūhaya, “Leka lūūlū nang'winhe nsango nang'hwe ū ntemi wa Ashulu, kūlwa būdooshi bo wikumīlīja wa mu ng'holò yakwe, na a kalolele kakwe ka kwigūngūhya we ng'wenekīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
